## Daily check-in, daily missions and limited-time missions: rewards, mission pools and words.
## State and counting live in main_3d.gd (see "Check-in and missions"); hud.gd draws the screens.
##
## Rewards are kept small next to the upgrade prices (40-200 coins) and vouchers stay rare:
## one voucher opens one supply case.

